+
+M1 compared the candidate's entity IDs, display names, aliases, event IDs, place IDs, relation tuple, and source IDs against the landed r87 Sumerian/ETCSL and r88-M3 Maya/Spence clusters. The fixture has no aliases or alternate names. Its relation endpoints and event pointers resolve only to its own entity rows. No named character, place, item, relation, event, field, or occasion in the fictional excerpts or records refers to a referent in either existing cluster. Source IDs are cluster-local; their comparison is only a namespace diagnostic.
+
